    visualDescription: "Diagram showing the flow: 'Seller' -> 'Sells asset to Irrevocable Trust' -> 'Trust issues installment note' -> 'Payments over 10-30 yrs' with a side note 'Tax paid as payments arrive.' Clean infographic style in brand colors.",
