    hashtags: "#537IST #CapitalGainsDeferral #Crypto #ConcentratedStock #TaxStrategy",
    visualDescription: "Graphic showing a single oversized coin/stock-chart icon teetering on a balance beam, with two labeled paths: 'Sell = big tax bill' and 'Hold = concentration risk,' and a third path lighting up labeled '537 IST.' Brand-colored.",
