    visualDescription: "7-slide carousel, deep purple + cream brand palette. Slide 1 (hook): a stopwatch graphic, bold text 'The 1031 clock nobody warns you about.' Slide 2: 'The IRS starts TWO clocks the day you close.' Slide 3: big '45 DAYS' / 'Identify replacement property in writing.' Slide 4: big '180 DAYS' / 'Close on it.' Slide 5: 'They run at the same time. Weekends count. No extensions.' Slide 6: 'You can't touch the money — a Qualified Intermediary holds it.' Slide 7 (CTA): 'Set up your QI BEFORE you close' + q-1031.com / (719) 714-1565, small disclaimer line at bottom 15%.",
    type: "Carousel",
